# --- Research tasks ---
# Track the method (design, strategy code, harness scripts) and the conclusions
# (report); leave the run outputs out. Per task the documents and code are ~100KB
# while `runs/` is 13-30MB of summary JSON that the harness regenerates from
# scratch -- cost without durability. `sweep_results.json` is the deliberate
# exception at 32-48KB: it is the compact per-cell aggregate every report table is
# built from, so it keeps a report checkable without shipping the runs.
#
# Git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded, so the task
# directories are re-included first and the exclusion is then applied to contents.
# Editing order matters here: a `!` line only works if every parent above it is
# already back in.
tasks/*
!tasks/*/
tasks/*/**
!tasks/*/*.md
!tasks/*/*.py
!tasks/*/report.html
!tasks/*/sweep_results.json
!tasks/*/window_results.json
!tasks/*/concentration.json
!tasks/*/add_trigger_results.json
!tasks/*/exchange_rate_results.json
!tasks/*/execution_reality_results.json
